{ COSY Infinity Lattice Converter                              }
{ Purpose: Auto-generation of maps (SMAPS) for Twiss functions }
{ Author: Kolokolchikov S.                                     }
{ Date: 2026-05-01 17:06:02                        }
{ Input file: C:/GIT_REPOS/SCT/COSY/src/magnetic_mod.fox       }
{ Output file: C:/GIT_REPOS/SCT/COSY/src/magnetic_mod_maps.fox }
